Error [E0121]: `batch` was consumed by `import`, so it can't be used here
  --> arrow_batch_use_after_move.jet:5:19
    |
  5 |     arrow.import(^batch)
    |                   ^^^^^
  --> arrow_batch_use_after_move.jet:4:29
    |
  4 |     _moved :: arrow.import(^batch)
    |                             ^^^^^ `batch` moved to `import` here
 Why: After a value moves somewhere else, its old name no longer gives access to it
 Fix: Stop using `batch` after the move, or give `import` a copy with `batch.copy()` where it moved.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0121
